          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto, margin",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>is not worth a quarter.</li>\n<li>And now, by God,</li>\n<li>if I had in the house</li>\n<li>one dirhem I would grant you a loan,</li>\n<li>my master. However,</li>\n<li>I have sold</li>\n<li>the sugar alone</li>\n<li>and lost half a dinar</li>\n<li>..... [ ....</li></ol>\n\n<p></p>",
